TASK 3.3 — Conditional injection in QtDocumentCenterView
========================================================================================
FILE: ui/views/document_center_view.py (MODIFIED)

  ADD STATE TRACKING:
    _admin_tab_injected: bool = False
    _admin_panel_view: Optional[QWidget] = None
    _admin_tab_index: int = -1

  NO CHANGES TO _build_ui():
    - Tab 0: Documents (existing)
    - Tab 1: Automation (existing)
    - Tab 2: API Dashboard (existing)
    - ⚠ NO TAB 3 — admin tab is NOT added here

  NEW METHOD _try_inject_admin_tab() -> bool:
    1. If already injected → return True
    2. Call auth_manager.require_admin_async(self) → login dialog
    3. If False returned (cancelled/failed) → return False
    4. If True (authenticated):
       a. Create QWidget container page
       b. Lazy-import QtAdminPanelView, construct with api_client
       c. self._tab_widget.addTab(admin_page, "")
       d. self._admin_tab_index = self._tab_widget.count() - 1
       e. Set tab text via t("admin.tab_title")
       f. self._admin_tab_injected = True
       g. return True

  NEW METHOD _eject_admin_tab():
    1. If not injected → return
    2. self._tab_widget.removeTab(self._admin_tab_index)
    3. Clear references, reset flags
    Called on: auth_manager.clear_auth(), logout, 401 detection

  UPDATE _on_tab_changed(index):
    - Only handles admin tab (index == self._admin_tab_index) if _admin_tab_injected
    - Call self._admin_panel_view.wakeup() if hasattr

  UPDATE _cleanup():
    - Call _eject_admin_tab()
    - Call shutdown() on admin_panel_view if exists

  ADD ADMIN ACCESS TRIGGER:
    - Small shield/gear icon button in the toolbar (next to search bar)
    - Text: t("admin.login_button", default="Admin")
    - On click:
      if _admin_tab_injected:
          self._tab_widget.setCurrentIndex(self._admin_tab_index)
      else:
          if self._try_inject_admin_tab():
              self._tab_widget.setCurrentIndex(self._admin_tab_index)
              if hasattr(self._admin_panel_view, 'wakeup'):
                  self._admin_panel_view.wakeup()

  UPDATE _refresh_tab_titles():
    - Does NOT touch index 3 unless _admin_tab_injected is True

  UPDATE _on_language_changed / _update_translations:
    - No admin-specific translations to update (admin tab removed/re-added on language change)

